WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Choose the page from the sidebar
From the sidebar choose “Branding”.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Open Branding
Choose Branding with an account that has the right permission.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Update the identity
Review the name, upload the right logo and choose the color from the available settings.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Save and review
Save the change and check how it appears in the interface.
